# M6 4a/4b (slices 345, 350): `a := value`, the named actual of 2026-11-07, is no form: since 350 P0 refuses the operator
# `:=` before any consumer reads the document, so no actual is computed and nothing falls back to a named or a
# positional supply; the named actual is written `a: value` (named_assign_actuals).
fn: tst (int: c 3; int: a 2) int
    return: c * 10 + a
end: tst
int: code 7
if: tst(a := 5) != 35
    code: 81
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
